{"description":"Drive the user's screen and Chrome/Edge tabs. 'apps'/'windows' find targets; 'observe' lists elements with marks (pass \"e7\" as 'element'; only the latest observe's marks work) and an open sheet/dialog as 'modal' (dismiss it first); 'screenshot' images the window, sized to what the model can see ('unchanged' if identical; 8 MiB per turn, then observe); 'zoom' shows a region at native resolution — after it, x/y are crop pixels the driver maps back (from_zoom). 'click'/'type'/'key'/'set'/'scroll'/'drag'/'menu'/'launch' act, settle (AX quiet 'quiet_ms', default 300), then re-read the window: 'changed' + capped 'diff'; 'verify' checks predicates, 'wait_for' polls them ≤10 s; 'browser*'/'navigate' drive tabs via 'tab'/'ref'; 'batch' runs ≤32 actions ('stop_if_changed' halts on a window change). 'clipboard_read'/'clipboard_write'; 'paste' puts 'text' on the clipboard, presses paste in pid's window, then restores it (prefer 'type' for text); 'key'/'paste' take 'element' to aim at a field. 'secret' types a credential by name. give x/y in the frame you were shown; they are mapped into the driver's pixel space. Nothing is screenshotted implicitly; a suppressed capture returns metadata only; credential fields are never typed into. Everything stays in the background: launched apps are hidden, and 'launch' refuses an app with a window on the user's screen (the user is notified) — do the task without it. 'browser' with no pid opens Overseer's own hidden browser (isolated profile); then 'navigate' its 'tab'.","input_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"description":"apps | windows | launch | observe | screenshot | zoom | click | type | key | set | scroll | drag | menu | verify | wait_for | browser | browser_click | browser_type | navigate | clipboard_read | clipboard_write | paste | batch","type":"string"},"actions":{"items":{"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"app":{"description":"name or bundle id to launch","type":"string"},"button":{"description":"left|right","type":"string"},"count":{"description":"1|2","type":"integer"},"cred_field":{"description":"target is a credential field","type":"boolean"},"depth":{"description":"observe depth cap","type":"integer"},"dx":{"type":"number"},"dy":{"type":"number"},"element":{"description":"mark from observe (\"e7\")"},"expect":{},"keys":{"description":"\"cmd+s\"|\"return\"","type":"string"},"limit":{"description":"observe cap (150)","type":"integer"},"max":{"type":"integer"},"open":{"description":"launch: absolute file path to open","type":"string"},"path":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"pid":{"description":"target app","type":"integer"},"query":{"type":"string"},"quiet_ms":{"description":"settle quiet window","type":"integer"},"ref":{"description":"browser element ref","type":"string"},"secret":{"description":"credential name for type/set","type":"string"},"stop_if_changed":{"type":"boolean"},"tab":{"description":"bound browser tab","type":"string"},"text":{"type":"string"},"timeout_ms":{"description":"wait_for cap (≤10000)","type":"integer"},"to_x":{"type":"number"},"to_y":{"type":"number"},"url":{"type":"string"},"value":{},"window_id":{"description":"target window","type":"integer"},"x":{"type":"number"},"x1":{"type":"number"},"x2":{"type":"number"},"y":{"type":"number"},"y1":{"type":"number"},"y2":{"type":"number"}},"required":["action"],"type":"object"},"name":"computer"}
